{"slug":"social-media-reacts-to-brittany-renner-dubbing-herself-americas-favorite-scout-during-giants-cowboys-game","postId":75131,"title":"Social Media Reacts To Brittany Renner Dubbing Herself America’s Favorite Scout During Giants & Cowboys Game","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":518836,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/brittany-renner-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-518836\"/><figcaption>Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Entrepreneur and author Brittany Renner was taking in the festivities that comes with the NFC East match between the Dallas Cowboys and the New York Giants at MetLife Stadium. Renner posted a photo on Instagram with the caption, \"America's favorite scout.\" </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Since she released the post, social media has had a field day with her Twitter and Instagram comments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/BillyM_91/status/1574568647015944192?s=20u0026t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/BillyM_91/status/1574568647015944192?s=20&amp;t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After Cee Dee Lamb dropped a wide-open pass at the Giants' 20-yard line Dallas based content channel Dallas Texas TV quote tweeted the message, \"CeeDee Lamb busy looking at what’s going on in the stands,\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/DallasTexasTV/status/1574570944688955415?s=20u0026t=zwuSMultacEvPNamgISV3g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/DallasTexasTV/status/1574570944688955415?s=20&amp;t=zwuSMultacEvPNamgISV3g\n</div><figcaption>Meanwhile, J. Stalin, who is the CEO of Livewire Records &amp; M.F.H. Distribution in Renner's IG comments said, \"Hide ya sons .\"</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Referencing Renner's relationship with her son's father, PJ Washington, who plays for the Charlotte Hornets.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Another Twitter user comment on her shoes \"The sketchers is crazyyyyyy.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/jcarp_410/status/1574594317389541376?s=20u0026t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/jcarp_410/status/1574594317389541376?s=20&amp;t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While another user wanted Renner to get away from his team, the Dallas Cowboys, from the videos on his page. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/MODELOKING2/status/1574571730382757913?s=20u0026t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/MODELOKING2/status/1574571730382757913?s=20&amp;t=vhD7pSvcYdeW2MuoGZ9wqQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Last month, Renner congratulated her ex Washington on his recent engagement to fiancee, Alisah Chanel  who is currently pregnant. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"\"Congrats y'all!!!\" Renner said, <a href=\"https://www.tmz.com/2022/08/31/brittany-renner-congratulates-pj-washington-engagement-alisah-chanel/\">according to TMZ</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->","excerpt":"Getty Images Entrepreneur and author Brittany Renner was taking in the festivities that comes with the NFC East match between the Dallas Cowboys and the New York Giants at MetLife Stadium. Renner…","publishedAt":"2022-09-27T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-09-27T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"brittany-renner","name":"Brittany Renner"},{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"cowboys","name":"Cowboys"},{"slug":"dallas-cowboys","name":"Dallas Cowboys"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"giants","name":"Giants"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"new-york-giants","name":"New York Giants"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/brittany-renner-1024x1024.png"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/brittany-renner-1024x1024.png"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/social-media-reacts-to-brittany-renner-dubbing-herself-americas-favorite-scout-during-giants-cowboys-game/"}